<section class="documentation-section typography" aria-labelledby="typography-title" data-gsap="reveal">
	<div class="documentation-section__intro">
		<h2 id="typography-title">Typography</h2>

		<pre class="typography__code"><code>@include text($size, $margin, $weight);</code></pre>

		<p>
			<strong>$size</strong>
			— font-size + line-height ·
			<strong>$margin</strong>
			— margin-bottom ·
			<strong>$weight</strong>
			— font-weight
		</p>

		<pre class="typography__code"><code>@include text(md, xs, 700)</code></pre>
		<p>
			Solo
			<code>$size</code>
			è obbligatorio. I parametri opzionali possono essere omessi.
		</p>
		<pre class="typography__code"><code>@include text(md, $weight: 700);</code></pre>

    <p> Utility class: <code>.text-{xs|sm|md|lg|xl|2xl|3xl|4xl}</code> </p>
	<p> Utility class: <code>.weight-{100|200|300|400|500|600|700|800|900}</code> </p>

	</div>

